\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
Question 13. What is the family of distributions that has margins and conditionals as sufficient statistics? What should the stationary distribution be for MCMC? Jon Forster asked, "Is it safe to release full conditionals that have been perturbed?" Aleksandra replied, "Probably not."

Luis Garcia

